Verifying PE 639 (Summing multiplicative fn):

f_3(n) = number of ordered triples (a,b,c) with abc=n
S(N) = Σ_{n=1..N} f_3(n) = #{(a,b,c): abc ≤ N}

S(10) = 53 (sieve: 53)
S(30) = 276 (sieve: 276)
S(100) = 1471 (sieve: 1471)
S(300) = 6333 (sieve: 6333)
S(1000) = 29425

